{
  "sequence_id": "seq_58858a2227cf3761",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Where are you headed?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "to West Park,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Soon I'll have exhausted my funds."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If push comes to shove, should I just ride for free under the pretext of an investigation?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "....."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You make candy?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I mean, your hobby."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Think you very much for this"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Shou"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Information"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Making Candy"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Kobayashi"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hobby"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh... yeah, though it's embarrassing."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I make things like cream puffs in the oven."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "that fluffy and flaky texture, and that whip cream spilling out."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Ohh-?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah, yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "From the shell?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Stuffing your mouth with the piping hot ones right out of the oven is supreme bliss."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hmm, how nice."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Today, I made some for lunch too."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"Today\"?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I do whenever I have some free time."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'm surprisingly addicted to it. It claims me down somehow."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How about you, onii-san?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Nah, I hate sweet things."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...U"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Right now, I have to say that the"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T17",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "KU-N."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Okay, this is good."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm not a fan of credit card"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Um... Right here is okay?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "!?"
    }
  ],
